OL,13,     FRed Star: Following Operation
OL,14,     FBarbarossa in 1941, the Soviet
OL,15,     FArmy battled the Germans almost
OL,16,     Falone for two years. Laurence
OL,17,     FOlivier recounts their efforts as
OL,18,     Fthe epic series continues.
